OL,3,GNEWSAVillage team triumphs in FA Cup
OL,4,Arow replay
OL,5,
OL,6,FVillage football club Mulbarton
OL,7,FWanderers saw off lower league rivals
OL,8,FWoodford Town to settle a controversial
OL,9,FFA Cup replay.
OL,11,FThe first meeting of the teams made
OL,12,Finternational headlines after the
OL,13,FFootball Association (FA) made the rare
OL,14,Fdecision to order a replay due to a
OL,15,Freferee's error.
OL,17,FA record crowd of 806 people attended
OL,18,Fthe match in Norfolk this evening, with
OL,19,FWanderers sealing progress thanks to a
OL,20,F2-0 win.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
